		{
			"id": "n311",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 420,
			"y": 940,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**13.** transfer, отладка, mixed precision"
		},
		{
			"id": "n314",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1190,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 420,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Цикл обучения\n```\nbatch → forward → loss\n  ↑                 ↓\nstep ← optimizer ← backward\n```\n`zero_grad → loss.backward() → step()`\n\n`model.eval()` для Dropout/BN!"
		},
		{
			"id": "n315",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 1190,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 420,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Против vanishing gradients\n- ReLU / GELU\n- Residual connections\n- BatchNorm / LayerNorm\n- He / Xavier init\n- LSTM / GRU\n- (exploding) gradient clipping"
		},
		{
			"id": "n316",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 1190,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 420,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Эволюция для текста\n```\nRNN → LSTM/GRU\n  → Seq2Seq (bottleneck)\n  → + Attention\n  → Transformer\n```\nWord2Vec → ELMo → BERT"
		}
	],
